{"synopsis":"Makhluk terkuat di Bumi,\nDia selalu merindukan pertempuran yang dapat membuatnya bersemangat.\nAkhirnya, terobsesi dengan pertarungan, dia merasuki tubuh seorang siswa SMA untuk merasakan kembali kegembiraan bertarung.\nSementara itu, Panglima Bumi yang tubuhnya disegel oleh dewa-dewa lain, berusaha untuk menjadi lebih kuat dengan tubuh baru ini dan melawan mereka.\nAkankah dia dapat mengalahkan para dewa dengan tubuh barunya dan terus merasakan kegembiraan bertarung?","alternative_title":"Earth Captain's School Life 지구대장님의 학교생활","author":"Kitaeon","artist":"Kitaeon","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"875ac65f-d751-44b0-ad0e-ffe3425aab25","number":"14","chapter":"14","title":"","date":"2025-03-21","released":"2025-03-21","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2723cd6e-438c-4769-9e48-6d72c8c04c5b/ch